<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Explore the modern facilities at Mother Teresa Public School - Library, Computer Lab, Playground, Smart Classes and more.">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1><i class="fas fa-building me-3"></i>Our Facilities</h1>
      <p>State-of-the-art infrastructure for an enriching learning experience</p>
      <div class="breadcrumb-custom">
        <a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span> <span>Facilities</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row g-4">
        <!-- Library -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 animate-on-scroll">
          <div class="facility-card">
            <div class="facility-img" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light)); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
              <i class="fas fa-book-reader" style="font-size:5rem; color:var(--white); opacity:0.8;"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <h4 style="font-family:var(--font-heading); color:var(--primary);">
                <i class="fas fa-book me-2" style="color:var(--secondary);"></i>Library
              </h4>
              <p class="text-muted">Our well-stocked library houses thousands of books covering a wide range of subjects including fiction, non-fiction, reference materials, encyclopedias, and age-appropriate reading materials. Students are encouraged to develop a reading habit through regular library periods.</p>
              <ul class="text-muted" style="font-size:0.9rem;">
                <li>5000+ books across all genres</li>
                <li>Dedicated reading room with comfortable seating</li>
                <li>Newspapers and educational magazines</li>
                <li>Digital catalog for easy search</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Computer Lab -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 animate-on-scroll">
          <div class="facility-card">
            <div class="facility-img" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--secondary), var(--secondary-light)); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
              <i class="fas fa-desktop" style="font-size:5rem; color:var(--primary-dark); opacity:0.8;"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <h4 style="font-family:var(--font-heading); color:var(--primary);">
                <i class="fas fa-laptop-code me-2" style="color:var(--secondary);"></i>Computer Lab
              </h4>
              <p class="text-muted">A modern computer lab equipped with the latest systems and high-speed internet access. Students learn programming fundamentals, digital literacy, and creative software applications starting from primary classes.</p>
              <ul class="text-muted" style="font-size:0.9rem;">
                <li>30+ computers with latest configuration</li>
                <li>High-speed broadband internet</li>
                <li>Licensed educational software</li>
                <li>Trained computer instructor</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Playground -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 animate-on-scroll">
          <div class="facility-card">
            <div class="facility-img" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--success), #2ed573); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
              <i class="fas fa-futbol" style="font-size:5rem; color:var(--white); opacity:0.8;"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <h4 style="font-family:var(--font-heading); color:var(--primary);">
                <i class="fas fa-running me-2" style="color:var(--secondary);"></i>Playground
              </h4>
              <p class="text-muted">A spacious playground provides ample space for various outdoor activities and sports. Physical education is an integral part of our curriculum, promoting fitness and sportsmanship among students.</p>
              <ul class="text-muted" style="font-size:0.9rem;">
                <li>Large open ground for cricket, football, and athletics</li>
                <li>Dedicated play area for younger children</li>
                <li>Indoor games room (carrom, chess, table tennis)</li>
                <li>Annual sports day and inter-house competitions</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Smart Classes -->
        <div class="col-lg-6 animate-on-scroll">
          <div class="facility-card">
            <div class="facility-img" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #ff6b6b); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;">
              <i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher" style="font-size:5rem; color:var(--white); opacity:0.8;"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
              <h4 style="font-family:var(--font-heading); color:var(--primary);">
                <i class="fas fa-tv me-2" style="color:var(--secondary);"></i>Smart Classes
              </h4>
              <p class="text-muted">Our classrooms are equipped with smart boards and projectors that bring lessons to life through audio-visual content, animations, and interactive exercises. This technology-enhanced learning helps students grasp complex concepts easily.</p>
              <ul class="text-muted" style="font-size:0.9rem;">
                <li>Interactive digital boards in every classroom</li>
                <li>Audio-visual learning content</li>
                <li>3D animations for science concepts</li>
                <li>Online test and assessment modules</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Additional Facilities -->
      <h2 class="section-title mt-5 pt-3">More Facilities</h2>
      <div class="section-divider"></div>
      <div class="row g-4 mt-2">
        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 animate-on-scroll">
          <div class="custom-card text-center">
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="card-icon mx-auto"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i></div>
              <h6>Science Lab</h6>
              <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size:0.85rem;">Hands-on experiments and practical learning in Physics, Chemistry, and Biology.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 animate-on-scroll">
          <div class="custom-card text-center">
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="card-icon yellow mx-auto"><i class="fas fa-bus-alt"></i></div>
              <h6>Transport</h6>
              <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size:0.85rem;">Safe and comfortable transportation service covering major routes in and around Mahnar.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 animate-on-scroll">
          <div class="custom-card text-center">
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="card-icon green mx-auto"><i class="fas fa-first-aid"></i></div>
              <h6>Medical Room</h6>
              <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size:0.85rem;">First-aid facility with trained staff. Regular health check-ups for all students.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 animate-on-scroll">
          <div class="custom-card text-center">
            <div class="card-body">
              <div class="card-icon red mx-auto"><i class="fas fa-video"></i></div>
              <h6>CCTV Surveillance</h6>
              <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="font-size:0.85rem;">24/7 CCTV monitoring for the safety and security of all students on campus.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
